EN:
Today's the day {{TAG:0003:0025:}}to do something
about any weeds in town!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Yup!
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Pull and pull and pull some more!
Who{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}? Why YOU, of course!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
I'll be cheering for you, though!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
Oggi dobbiamo dedicarci{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
alle erbacce della nostra città!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
La parola d'ordine è: strappare!
Io ho altro da fare{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Quindi lascio
a te le erbacce!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Ma farò il tifo per
te, promesso!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Nach dem Unkrautjäten{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}hat mir
zwei Tage lang alles wehgetan...{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Zum Glück war's nur ein Traum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Denkst du, ich schlage mich echt mit
Unkraut herum? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ot yoladıktan sonra,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}kaslarım iki gün
boyunca ağrımıştı{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0012:}}
Aman,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} bugün değil! {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Bir keresinde
gördüğüm rüyayı anlatıyorum! {{TAG:0003:001C:}}
Cidden gidip ot yoladığımı mı sandın? {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Hoy es el Día del Hierbajo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Si se te acaban las malas hierbas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
te puedes ir al pueblo de al lado
a seguir.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Ot Yolma Günü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Buradaki işin
bitince hâlâ gücün kaldıysa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
başka bir kasabaya uğrayıp yardım etsene?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ya que vamos a limpiar el pueblo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
he decidido empezar por mi casa.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Eso pensé anoche en la cama.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ahora que toca ponerse,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} no estoy
tan convencido,{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}I think weed pulling is like painting.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
You gotta do it a little bit at a time.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Not that I've ever painted before.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Desherbar es como estudiar:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
no lo puedes hacer todo de golpe,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
tienes que ir poco a poco.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}No tengo ni idea de lo que estoy
hablando.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Se me ha notado?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Le désherbage, c'est comme tout...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Il faut y aller avec modération.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} On 
est pas des machines quand même...

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Unkraut loswerden ist wie Malen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Man muss sich Stück für Stück
vorarbeiten.
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Nicht, dass ich je was gemalt hätte!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Basta!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Finalmente mi sono deciso
a pulire la mia stanza!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Le erbacce fuori casa le lascio a te,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. Sono tutte tue!
Divertiti! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Tamamdır!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bugün şu odamı nihayet adam edeceğim!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
Ama dışarıdaki otları sana bırakıyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
giriş bakalım,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!
